 "notes": "CAPP-PACE haloscope. Curve from Fig.4 (main panel), which plots |g_gamma/g_gamma^KSVZ| vs m_a. Recovered the bottom edge of the red excluded region by pixel/colour extraction (y-axis calibrated from major ticks 10^0-10^4 at rows 1354->202; ratio=1 dashed KSVZ line at y=1354). Converted to g_agamma via g_agamma = ratio * g_agamma^KSVZ, with g_agamma^KSVZ = g_gamma*alpha/(pi*f_a), g_gamma=0.97 (paper's value), f_a=5.7e12/m_a[ueV] GeV from m_a=5.7ueV*(1e12GeV/f_a). Excluded band 10.16-11.37 ueV at ~8-10x KSVZ (plateau ~9x), with a narrow notch reaching near-KSVZ sensitivity (ratio~1.1) at 10.7126-10.7186 ueV (KSVZ run); notch captured by min in 10.705-10.725 ueV bin plus explicit deep point at 10.7134 ueV. rho_a=0.45 GeV/cm^3 (paper). 90% CL. Small real gaps (bluetooth ~2.48GHz, TE crossings 2.5-2.6/2.74GHz) smoothed over.",
